(1,'B17-2018-26','THREE (03) MONTHS MANDATORY PRE-PROMOTION/ MID  CAREER TRAINING:','instructions issued vide letter No. SO E-III/5-7/Admin Cadre/2026 (Appendix-I) & to state that the Local Governance School (LGS) has arranged Three (03) months pre-promotion / mid-career training for the LGS-PUGF Officers (BPS-17 Admin Cadre) list attached, as per schedule given below;\r\n\r\nStarting Date: 1st September 2026 to 30th November 2026.\r\nTime: 	     09:00 am to 04:00 p.m.\r\nVenue:             Local Governance School\r\n	                                 Street#13 Sector E-8 Building #33 Phase-VII, Hayatabad Peshawar\r\nIn view of the above, you are therefore directed to report to Local Governance School on 1st September, 2026 at 08:30 am positively.\r\nI am further directed to inform you that during the subject training the following dress code should be followed.\r\nGents:\r\nWhite Shalwar Kameez, Black Coat/Vest Coat & Black Shoes.\r\n\r\nLadies:\r\nComplete white dress and black shoes\r\n\r\nNote: \r\n1) Trainees without dress code shall not be allowed in the Training. \r\n2) Administrative Note for logistic support is overleaf.','mid_career_training','specialized',180,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,3,'ongoing',1,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-09-02 01:14:01','2026-09-02 04:37:28',NULL);
